# Ship interiors for this race.
#
# These are GENERATED systems-only layouts: the damageable nodes only, derived
# from shipData (beams, tubes, shields, sensors, impulse, maneuver, drive) and
# placed by the zone grammar in sbs_utils/GRID_REFERENCE.md s5. Without them
# these hulls have a DEAD Engineering console.
#
# They are a floor, not a design. Edit freely - they are ordinary floor plans.
